nt of ships that cannot selfintersect or visit a tile twice. When done drawing they can start the simulation and see the outcome their routs produced. If the ships reach their goal without collision and while satisfying all victory conditions they win and advance to the next level. Over the course of the game more and more interacting mechanics get added to the game, requiring players to supply outposts with vital cargo, unlock new passages, juggle items, avoid hostile drones and support allied ships.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/trails", "videos": [{"id": 148831, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "jcl6h1oa65o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jcl6h1oa65o", "title": "Trails | Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jcl6h1oa65o/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}